<view class="container">
  <view class="privacy-badge">{{privacyBadge}}</view>
  <view class="banner-note">
    对照剪影站好即可开拍（非姿态识别）。服务端会实检：时长、分辨率、亮度、朝向。
  </view>
  <view class="banner-note" wx:if="{{isRetest}}" style="background:#eef2ff;color:#3730a3;">
    复测模式：将关联基准视频 #{{baselineVideoId}}（仅骨架对比，非评分）
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">拍摄模式</view>
    <view class="mode-toggle">
      <view class="mode-btn {{filmMode==='self'?'on':''}}" data-mode="self" bindtap="setFilmMode">自己拍</view>
      <view class="mode-btn {{filmMode==='cameraman'?'on':''}}" data-mode="cameraman" bindtap="setFilmMode">帮别人拍</view>
    </view>
    <view class="muted" wx:if="{{filmMode==='self'}}">自拍：对准全身后开录；不会自动截取挥拍片段。</view>
    <view class="muted" wx:else>帮别人拍：倒计时后打开相机/相册；请对准全身，挥拍时按录。不会自动截取 3 秒高光。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card silhouette-card">
    <view class="card-title">参考框 · 身体剪影</view>
    <view class="silhouette-wrap">
      <view class="silhouette translucent">
        <view class="sil-head"></view>
        <view class="sil-body"></view>
        <view class="sil-legs"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="ref-frame-overlay"></view>
    </view>
    <view class="cameraman-tip" wx:if="{{filmMode==='cameraman'}}">对准全身，挥拍时按录</view>
    <view class="soft-tips">
      <view class="tip-line" wx:for="{{softTips}}" wx:key="*this">· {{item}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">持拍手</view>
    <view class="hand-toggle">
      <view class="hand-btn {{handedness==='right'?'on':''}}" data-hand="right" bindtap="setHandedness">右手</view>
      <view class="hand-btn {{handedness==='left'?'on':''}}" data-hand="left" bindtap="setHandedness">左手</view>
    </view>
    <view class="muted">默认右手；左手将用于杀球/高远等优势侧指标。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">选择或录制视频</view>
    <view class="muted">现场拍摄最长 {{liveMaxSec}} 秒（微信相机上限）；从相册选择最长 60 秒。服务端要求 5–60 秒，竖屏。</view>
    <view class="btn-primary" style="margin-top:16rpx;" bindtap="onStartCapture">
      {{filmMode==='cameraman' ? '倒计时后从相册/相机选择' : '从相册/相机选择视频'}}
    </view>
    <view class="btn-ghost" style="margin-top:16rpx;" bindtap="toggleCamera">{{showCamera ? '关闭相机预览' : '打开相机预览（真机）'}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{showCamera}}">
    <camera device-position="back" flash="off" style="width:100%;height:420rpx;"></camera>
    <view class="muted" style="margin-top:12rpx;">开发者工具里 camera 可能不好用，请用「选择视频」。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{videoPath}}">
    <view class="card-title">已选视频</view>
    <video src="{{videoPath}}" controls style="width:100%;"></video>
    <view class="muted">{{videoInfo}}</view>
    <view class="btn-primary" style="margin-top:16rpx;" bindtap="doUpload" wx:if="{{!uploading && !failChecks.length}}">上传并预检</view>
    <view class="muted" wx:if="{{uploading}}">上传中…</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{failChecks.length}}">
    <view class="card-title" style="color:#b91c1c;">{{brightnessOnlyFail ? '光线偏暗' : '预检未通过 — 请重拍'}}</view>
    <view wx:for="{{failChecks}}" wx:key="id" class="fail-item">
      · {{item.friendly || item.message}}
    </view>
    <view class="muted" wx:if="{{brightnessOnlyFail}}" style="margin-top:12rpx;">
      暗场馆常见。优先重拍到更亮处；若无法改善，可确认风险后仍要上传（时长/分辨率/朝向仍须合格）。
    </view>
    <view class="btn-primary" style="margin-top:20rpx;" bindtap="retake">重新拍</view>
    <view
      class="btn-ghost"
      style="margin-top:16rpx;"
      wx:if="{{brightnessOnlyFail && !uploading}}"
      bindtap="doUploadForce"
    >仍要上传（可能影响分析精度）</view>
  </view>

  <view class="muted" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>

  <!-- O4 cameraman countdown overlay -->
  <view class="countdown-overlay" wx:if="{{countdownActive}}">
    <view class="countdown-frame">
      <view class="countdown-sil">
        <view class="sil-head"></view>
        <view class="sil-body"></view>
        <view class="sil-legs"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="countdown-num">{{countdownNum}}</view>
      <view class="countdown-tip">对准全身，挥拍时按录</view>
      <view class="muted countdown-note">不会自动截取 3 秒挥拍</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
